---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ContentSection from '../components/ContentSection.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Products | DGCRANE</title>
    <meta name="description" content="" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/rich-content.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/technical-product.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/product-collections.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/product-media.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/inquiry-form.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pack.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/products.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/article.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about-contact.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/equipment-landing.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/sample.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="dgcrane-pack dgcrane-responsive ">
    <div id="wrapper">
      <Header />
      <div class="banner">
        <img src="/wp-content/themes/website/image/blog_banner.jpg" alt="crane banner" width="1440" height="300" />
        <div class="con wrap">
          <h2>Crane Manufacturer and Exporter</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              10+ Years of Crane Export Experience
            </li>
            <li>
              Cranes Are Sold To 120+ Countries
            </li>
            <li>
              A Technical Team of 50+ People
            </li>
            <li>
              3000+ Cases in Various Industries
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="sample-breadcrumb wrap" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">Products</span></nav>
      <main class="sample-catalog wrap">
        <h1>Products</h1>
        <div class="sample-card-grid">
          <article>
            <a href="/agv-transfer-carts/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/AGV-Transfer-Carts.jpg" alt="AGV Transfer Carts" />
            <h3>Advanced AGV Transfer Carts/Trolleys for Automated and Efficient Material Transport</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/products/electromagnetic-lifting-magnets/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Round-Electromagnetic-Lifting-Magnets.png" alt="Round electromagnetic lifting magnet" />
            <h3>Crane Electromagnetic Lifting Magnets: For Safe And Efficient Steel Handling</h3>
            <p>Electromagnetic lifting magnets for steel plates, scrap, billets, coils and other ferromagnetic loads.</p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/products/double-girder-eot-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/5Ton-NLH-European-Type-double-girder-overhead-crane-1.jpg" alt="5t NLH European-style Double Girder Overhead Crane 1" />
            <h3>Double Girder Overhead Crane</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="/products/double-trolley-overhead-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/themes/website/image/products_list.jpg" alt="crane banner" width="1440" height="300" />
            <h3>Double Trolley Overhead Cranes: High-Efficiency Handling and Versatile Applications</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="/products/gantry-cranes/"><img src="/editor-assets/gantry-cranes/gantry-banner.jpg" alt="Gantry crane in factory" />
            <h3>Gantry Cranes</h3>
            <p>From light workshop handling to heavy-duty lifting, our 5 types of gantry cranes provide reliable, customized solutions for diverse industries—covering construction sites, machinery manufacturing plants, concrete precast yards, shipyards, and mines and quarries.</p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/low-headroom-overhead-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/ldc-low-headroom-overhead-crane.jpg" alt="Low Headroom Overhead Cranes" />
            <h3>Low Headroom Overhead Cranes</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="/products/shipyard-portal-cranes/"><img src="/media/shipyard/Shipyard-Portal-Cranes-870x580.jpg" alt="Shipyard Portal Cranes" width="870" height="580" srcset="/media/shipyard/Shipyard-Portal-Cranes-870x580.jpg 1x, /media/shipyard/Shipyard-Portal-Cranes-900x600.jpg 2x" />
            <h3>Shipyard Portal Cranes</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <a href="/products/single-girder-eot-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/5Ton-LDC-type-single-girder-overhead-crane-in-India-1.jpg" alt="5Ton LDC type single girder overhead crane in India 1" />
            <h3>Single Girder Eot Cranes</h3>
            <p></p>
            <p>Read More</p>
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <ContentSection class="">
          <h2>The Right Product Solution</h2>
          <div class="sample-card-grid">
            <article class="">
              <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/single-girder-overhead-crane-types/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/single-girder-overhead-crane-types-menu.jpg" alt="single girder overhead crane types menu" width="276" height="184" />
              <h3>Single Girder Overhead Cranes</h3>
              <p>Whether you are in the procurement plan in progress, or are determining the customized scheme of plant lifting equipment, if the lifting capacity requirement is 20ton and below, single girder overhead travelling crane with the advantages of simple structure, flexible scheme and easy dismantling and transportation can be your second choice.</p>
              <p>Learn More</p>
              </a>
            </article>
            <article class="">
              <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/products/double-girder-gantry-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/Double_Girder_Gantry_Crane.jpg" alt="Double_Girder_Gantry_Crane" width="276" height="184" />
              <h3>Double Girder Gantry Cranes</h3>
              <p>MG general gantry crane is a crane designed and manufactured in accordance with national and industry standards such as GB/T3811 &quot;Crane Design Specification&quot; and GB/T14406 &quot;General Gantry Crane&quot;. The crane is suitable for indoor or open-air operations, used for lifting materials, and equipment installation and maintenance. The crane is composed of gantry steel structure, trolley, crane traveling mechanism, and electrical system, etc. Outdoor cranes are also equipped with rail clamps, anchoring devices, cable anchoring devices, wind speed/wind direction meters and other devices.</p>
              <p>Learn More</p>
              </a>
            </article>
            <article class="">
              <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/products/free-standing-jib-cranes/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/Free_Standing_Jib_Crane.jpg" alt="Free_Standing_Jib_Crane" width="276" height="184" />
              <h3>Free Standing Jib Cranes</h3>
              <p>Free standing jib cranes are designed to stand on the land not by any other support but by themselves. It consists of a pivoting vertical column and a horizontal load supporting boom.We rely on not low jib cranes price but the high quality of free standing jib cranes to win to achieve the growing of our company.</p>
              <p>Learn More</p>
              </a>
            </article>
            <article class="">
              <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/products/wire-rope-hoist-suppliers/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/European_Wire_Rope_Electric_Hoist.jpg" alt="European_Wire_Rope_Electric_Hoist" width="276" height="184" />
              <h3>FEM Standard Wire Rope Electric Hoists</h3>
              <p>The hoisting mechanism of the European type electric wire rope hoist adopts planetary gears, which has a compact and light structure and is installed in the reel, effectively reducing the overall size of the hoist. The design of the European type electric wire rope hoist adopts modular design to the greatest extent, and the degree of commonality of the components is high.</p>
              <p>Learn More</p>
              </a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </ContentSection>
      </main>
      <Footer />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
